  "source_caveat": "Mission 35 is a read-only typed evidence-to-claim boundary for Research Lab 14. Authentic original BEA, Census and BLS macroeconomic measurements may support precisely attributed internal economic statements, but cannot prove customer freight invoices, contract bill overcharges, customer consent, independent buyer demand, audit accuracy, collected refunds, recoverable total addressable market or authority to contact carriers. The 2024 nominal BEA gross output minus Census employer-revenue difference of $142607.754 million is a population and accounting contrast, not a freight billing error or recovery fund. Nine of ten fictional reviewer agreements in synthetic fixtures are NOT independent human accuracy. The existing Mission 11 pilot preflight has exactly eighteen human evidence controls in six stages, every one unmet. A passing GitHub workflow, SHA-256 consistency receipt, or independent public macroeconomic source does not satisfy privacy, legal, buyer, reviewer, finance or external publication signoff. This module approves internal education with caveats only and must never publish marketing claims or use real customer data."
